cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "The networks of the Italian Constituent Assembly (1946–1948)"
abstract: >-
  A network dataset on the 581 members of the Italian Constituent Assembly. It contains one formal network (membership of the Assembly's bodies)
  and several interaction networks built from day-to-day activity in the chamber
  and in committee: shared discussion topics, co-presence in the records,
  co-signed amendments (with proposer and signatories), mentions of members in
  speeches, and roll-call votes. Amendments, mentions and votes are reconstructed
  from the printed proceedings by OCR; their accuracy is documented in the codebook.
type: dataset
